"`send_position_percent` use the switch / percent channels (force feedback"
" while closing). On **basic_joint_controller** hands, the same "
"percent/switch topics blend Home open/close configs "
"(`target_command_enabled`)."
msgstr ""
"在 **adaptive_gripper_controller** 上，`send_joint_positions` 是直接位置模式（**无力反馈**）。`send_target_command` / `send_position_percent` 走开关 / 比例通道（关闭时有力反馈）。在 **basic_joint_controller** 手上，同样的比例/开关话题混合 Home 开合构型（`target_command_enabled`）。"

